---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionScrollNav from '../components/SectionScrollNav.vue';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { NAV_HOME_BASE } from '../data/site';

const lastUpdated = 'September 2026';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions - Slovenia Games Conference 2027">
  <SectionScrollNav client:load base={NAV_HOME_BASE} />

  <main class="legal-page">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="container legal-hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Slovenia Games Conference 2027</p>
        <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-body-section">
      <div class="container legal-body">
        <p>
          These Terms &amp; Conditions ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the
          Slovenia Games Conference website (the "Site") and your registration for and
          attendance at the Slovenia Games Conference 2027 (the "Conference"). The
          Conference is organised by the Slovenia Games Association ("we", "us", or
          "our"). By using the Site or registering for the Conference, you agree to these
          Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site or register for the event.
        </p>

        <h2>1. The Conference</h2>
        <p>
          The Slovenia Games Conference is an annual event dedicated to game development,
          design, art, marketing, and business. The Conference takes place at the Faculty
          of Computer and Information Science, Večna pot 113, 1000 Ljubljana, Slovenia. The
          programme, speakers, schedule, and venue arrangements are subject to change.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Registration &amp; Tickets</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Registration and, where applicable, a valid ticket are required to attend the Conference.</li>
          <li>You agree to provide accurate and complete information when registering.</li>
          <li>Tickets are issued for personal use and may not be resold or transferred for commercial gain without our prior written consent.</li>
          <li>We reserve the right to refuse admission or registration at our discretion, including where these Terms or our Code of Conduct are breached.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Payments, Cancellations &amp; Refunds</h2>
        <p>
          Ticket prices and payment terms will be published on the Site when ticket sales
          open. Unless required by applicable law or stated otherwise at the point of sale,
          tickets are non-refundable. If the Conference is cancelled by the organisers, we
          will offer either a transfer to a rescheduled date or a refund of the ticket price.
          We are not responsible for any travel, accommodation, or other costs you incur.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Code of Conduct</h2>
        <p>
          We are committed to providing a friendly, safe, and welcoming environment for
          everyone. Harassment, discrimination, or disruptive behaviour of any kind will not
          be tolerated. Attendees who violate these standards may be removed from the
          Conference without a refund and may be refused entry to future events. By attending,
          you agree to follow the instructions of the organisers and venue staff.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Changes to the Programme</h2>
        <p>
          Speakers, sessions, schedules, and other programme details are indicative and may
          change without notice. We will make reasonable efforts to keep the Site up to date,
          but we do not guarantee that any particular speaker or session will take place.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Photography &amp; Recording</h2>
        <p>
          Photography, audio, and video recording may take place during the Conference for
          promotional, archival, and educational purposes. By attending, you acknowledge that
          you may appear in such materials and grant us the right to use them. If you do not
          wish to be featured, please contact the organisers on site or by email in advance.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on the Site — including text, graphics, logos, and images — is owned by
          the Slovenia Games Association or its licensors and is protected by applicable
          intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or otherwise use this
          content without our prior written permission. Materials presented by speakers remain
          the property of their respective owners.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          The Site may contain links to third-party websites and services (for example, ticket
          providers, sponsors, or social media). We are not responsible for the content,
          policies, or practices of those third parties. Accessing them is at your own risk and
          subject to their terms.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for any indirect,
          incidental, or consequential loss or damage arising from your use of the Site or your
          attendance at the Conference. Attendees are responsible for their own personal
          belongings and conduct throughout the event.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Slovenia. Any disputes arising
          from or in connection with these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction
          of the competent courts in Ljubljana, Slovenia.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms from time to time. The current version will always be
          available on this page, with the "Last updated" date shown above. Continued use of the
          Site or attendance at the Conference after changes take effect constitutes acceptance
          of the revised Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us at
          <a href="mailto:info@sgc.si">info@sgc.si</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
.legal-page {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 100vh;
  background-color: #0f1419;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(255, 79, 18, 0.16), transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10, 12, 15, 0.62), rgba(10, 12, 15, 0.88)),
    url('/coming-soon-bg.jpg');
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-attachment: fixed;
}

.legal-hero { padding: 8.5rem 0 1.6rem; }
.legal-hero-inner { width: min(820px, 94%); }
.eyebrow { margin: 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }
.legal-hero h1 { margin: 0.45rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6vw, 4rem); line-height: 0.96; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #ffffff; font-family: "Funnel Sans", "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
.legal-updated { margin: 0.85rem 0 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 0.92rem; }

.legal-body-section { padding: 1rem 0 5rem; }
.legal-body {
  width: min(820px, 94%);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
  font-size: 1.02rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 2.6rem 2.8rem 2.8rem;
  box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
}
.legal-body > p:first-child { font-size: 1.08rem; color: #ffffff; }

.legal-body h2 {
  margin: 2.4rem 0 0.7rem;
  font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 1.55rem);
  color: #ffffff;
  font-family: "Funnel Sans", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.legal-body p { margin: 0.7rem 0 0; }
.legal-body ul { margin: 0.7rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.3rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.45rem; }
.legal-body li { line-height: 1.6; }
.legal-body strong { color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; }

.legal-body a { color: #ff8a5c; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
.legal-body a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
